      "content": "\"immediate, quiet relief\"... that sounds like a way of saying just giving up. if the effort is just a performance, then what is the point of the performance? it feels like i'm just dragging this heavy, pointless thing around until i die. wouldn't it be more logical to just... stop? to just let the emptiness take over instead of fighting it?",
